drop 1
drop 3
got 2
drop 2
drop 4
got 5
drop 5
got 6
drop 6
drop 8
got 7
drop 7
drop 10
got 9
drop 9
drop 11
got 12
drop 12
got 13
drop 13
got 14
drop 14
